Description: Extract fully qualified function names from published packages
 codelift downloads a package from its registry, inspects its source or
 metadata, and prints every fully qualified function, method and class name it
 contains. It covers npm, PyPI, NuGet, Maven, Cargo, Go and RubyGems, and
 resolves an informal vulnerability-report function reference to the canonical
 symbol name for a given package version.
